From: gt510 <gt510@localhost>
Subject: software ISP: contrast-detection autofocus

- swstats: focus measure (green differences) for 10-bit packed Bayer
- IPA: Af algorithm (coarse + fine sweep, refocus on scene change),
  enabled per sensor from the tuning file
- soft IPA interface, SoftwareIsp and the simple pipeline: move the
  sensor's focus lens (CameraSensor::focusLens) on request
